      "representation": "described_measures",
      "measure_count": 200,
      "limits": "Only the city-qualified NZAD localities Auckland–Avondale and Wellington–Kelburn, five published dwelling categories and bedroom categories 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5+. Weekly NZD rent quartiles describe bonds lodged during one inclusive six-month window. Active bonds are a separate count, not the quartile denominator. These provisional aggregates do not describe current listings, availability or an individual property. Absent tuples are not reported; no zero or suppression is inferred. Locality identifiers are site-owned, not official NZAD codes.",
      "locality_identifier_authority": "Morning Rows; not a publisher geography code",
      "selection": "Only reported tuples produce observations. Known absent tuples return not_reported; unsupported IDs return unknown_measure. An observation selects the exact inclusive six-month start/end period.",
